OL,3,GNEWSASussex 'Quantum Silicon Valley'
OL,4,Avision a step closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA quantum computing lab in Sussex has
OL,7,Fraised more than #82m ($100m) from
OL,8,Finvestors.
OL,10,FUniversity of Sussex said the money
OL,11,Fwould speed up the development of
OL,12,Fpowerful next-generation quantum
OL,13,Fcomputers at its Haywards Heath
OL,14,Fresearch facility, Quantum Universal.
OL,16,FQuantum computers are designed to solve
OL,17,Fcomplex problems that would take
OL,18,Fcurrent ones far longer to process, and
OL,19,Fcould lead to advancement in areas such
OL,20,Fas drug development, new materials and
OL,21,Fcleaner energy systems.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
