OL,3,GNEWSASussex 'Quantum Silicon Valley'
OL,4,Avision a step closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FVice-chancellor Prof Sasha Roseneil
OL,7,Fsaid the funding meant bringing the
OL,8,Funiversity's vision of creating a
OL,9,F"Quantum Silicon Valley" in Sussex
OL,10,Fcloser to reality.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
